    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Lead Qualification flow\n\n1. Receive a lead on the webhook.\n2. Create it in the API (`POST /api/v1/leads`, idempotent via `Idempotency-Key` = email).\n3. Qualify it (`POST /api/v1/leads/{id}/qualify`) - deterministic rules + Ollama.\n4. Route on `decision`: `qualified` / `nurture` / `disqualified`.\n5. Qualified leads get an AI follow-up draft (`POST /api/v1/leads/{id}/follow-up-draft`).\n\n**Change the base URL** (`host.docker.internal:8000`) if the API runs elsewhere.\nIf the API uses `API_KEY`, add a `Header Auth` credential to both HTTP nodes.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "b1c6a1d0-0013-4a10-9000-000000000014",
      "name": "How this workflow works",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, 260]
    }
